OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with some showers. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will become
OL,8,Fdrier with some clear intervals, just
OL,9,Fthe odd shower in Argyll.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,12,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,13,Fa few showers, turning heavier in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Strong to gale southwest
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
